    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d448">

                <pb facs="0548" n="538" sameAs="frus:frus1944v02/pg538"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.796/9–1344</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Assistant Secretary
                        of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Berle</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-09-13">September 13, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Icelandic Minister<anchor n="77a" xml:id="d448-f1"/> came in to see me at his
                    request and wanted some background on the proposed air conference. I gave him a
                    copy of the press release which includes the text of the invitation and
                    generally indicated the problems to be discussed.</p>
                <p>The Minister asked whether the Conference would be decisive or whether it would
                    be consultative taking decisions which had to be referred to the Government. I
                    told him in respect of provisional arrangements I hoped it would be as decisive
                    as possible to better present transitional air arrangements. As to all other
                    matters, of course, it could only be consultative.</p>
                <p>I told him we were interested in making more precise the arrangements presently
                    in effect for most favored nation and national treatment for fields such as the
                    airfield at Keflavik and that I hoped he would discuss the details with Mr.
                    Stokeley Morgan.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>A. A. B[<hi rendition="#small-caps">erle</hi>], <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Jr</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d448-f1" n="77a" xml:id="d448-f1-content">
